cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "PHYS-TRUST Lite: Trust-Adaptive Physics-Informed Air Quality Sensing"
abstract: "Air quality estimation on one low-cost Arduino node (MQ135 + DHT11). A Kalman filter fuses sensor physics, room mass-balance physics and an LSTM-ensemble prior, weighting each by a live trust score, with a 90% conformal uncertainty band and fault detection. Live React dashboard, local Gemma 3 explanations, 9% lower error than fixed-weight fusion."
